  "description": "Welcome to Darkness Falls, a quiet sanctuary for the supernatural nestled in a shadowed corner of New England. The Yokai Detective Agency is the enforcer of this haven and follows a diverse group of supernatural beings. Homicide Detective Ren Black has been battling the aftermath of his partner and lover's murder. Shutting himself away in his grief for a year, a new partner assignment in a young kumiho named Hiro Akashi coincides with the return of the serial killer that took away his light. Take a trip to Darkness Falls and see what lies in wait. Even shadows need a sanctuary.",
